/**
 * Validate retrieval of a single BBS category by ID (success scenario).
 *
 * This test verifies that the API correctly returns the details of a category
 * when given a valid category UUID. It is crucial for workflows such as
 * category selection and detail pages, ensuring end users and admin staff see
 * accurate information (name, description, created_at) for requested categories.
 *
 * Process:
 * 1. Create a new category (using the admin-level category creation endpoint)
 * 2. Retrieve that category by its UUID using the get-by-id endpoint
 * 3. Assert that all returned fields (name, description, created_at) match the
 *    data used in creation and are in the correct format
 */
