1. Set up a legitimate BBS post as a voting target by calling the /bbs/posts POST endpoint with valid post data. This is necessary to obtain a post_id that can be used in the vote.
2. Log out or use a connection with no authentication (simulate a guest user). This means that the connection will not carry an access/bearer token.
3. Attempt to cast a vote by calling the /bbs/votes POST endpoint with the post_id from step 1 and a valid value (+1 or -1).
4. Assert that the vote creation request fails with an authentication error (access denied because no user is logged in). Confirm that the vote endpoint cannot be used without authentication.

