/**
 * Delete a vote (votes table, enforced by unique user/target constraint).
 *
 * This operation deletes a vote record from the database. Only the vote's owner
 * (voter) or privileged roles (moderator/admin, based on 'user_roles') can
 * perform this operation. It removes the vote, freeing up the user to vote
 * again on the same post or comment in the future (as controlled by unique
 * constraints in the votes schema).
 *
 * Error responses are returned if the request is forbidden, the vote does not
 * exist, or the operation is not permitted for the resource. The operation
 * complies with audit and permission rules from requirements analysis and
 * schema.
 *
 * @param props.connection
 * @param props.id Vote record's ID to delete.
 * @path /bbs/votes/:id
 * @autobe Generated by AutoBE - https://github.com/wrtnlabs/autobe
 */
