 * management, profile viewing, and moderation. The returned details include
 * username, bio, email, role (with full description), account status, and
 * timestamps (created_at, updated_at). Account credentials (such as the
 * password_hash) are never returned for security reasons. The endpoint may be
 * used by administrators or moderators during audits, dispute resolution, or
 * assisting users. Follows the users Prisma schema for all properties and
 * relationships. Handles missing/deleted users gracefully with informative
 * error responses. Security validation restricts access to authorized roles
 * only, typically moderator or administrator.
